# venom_pro 1.07 - PAD-420: one port per newest build, from this build's framework-generation draft and the same
# title's proven port, with other titles' feature lines taken out (docs/plans/pad420_mode_sweep.md).
# Emulator-proven 2026-10-07 by a build check (modes/gamecheck.sh play, the stock card, hidden, muted):
# the runtime hooked the game, 26 of its 34 shots came from their switches, a drain ended a ball,
# events seen firing: game_start, ball_start, ball_end.
# Shots no press made: Left lock 1 opto, Left lock 2 opto, Left lock 3 opto, Left outlane, Right lock 1 opto, Right lock 2 opto, Right lock 3 opto, Right outlane.

game           venom_pro
version        1.07

